WEBVTT

00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:20.740
<i>If I'm so in your way,
 I'll just disappear from your sight!</i>

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:59.620
<b>I'm the Villainess,
So I'm Taming the  Final Boss</b>

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:59.620
<b>I'm the Villainess,
So I'm Taming the  Final Boss</b>

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:04.930
<b>The Villainess Always Gets Condemned</b>

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:05.970
You are... Belzebuth?

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:09.430
My lord is still willing to call me by name!

00:02:09.430 --> 00:02:12.750
My name is Keith, my lord.

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:14.470
Oh, this is unacceptable.

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:17.760
The cushions are placed at the wrong angle.

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:24.340
The tea looks terrible, as well. 
Let me prepare another cup.

00:02:30.740 --> 00:02:34.620
So? Are you planning on dissolving 
your engagement with Lady Aileen?

00:02:37.620 --> 00:02:39.590
It can't be helped, if that's your wish.

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:41.920
However, saying she's 
unneeded is going too far.

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:45.510
I don't remember raising you to hurt 
a woman's feelings unnecessarily.

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:46.910
I-I didn't!

00:02:47.320 --> 00:02:51.530
I just didn't want her to 
get any closer to me...

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:56.010
And your feelings were transmitted to 
the demons in a warped sort of way?

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:00.430
How does my lord feel about this?

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:04.870
Bel?!

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:08.300
There was poison on the chest, so I purified it.

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:09.530
Damn humans!

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:13.050
Please think before you act!

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:14.590
I don't care.

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:16.420
Bel, put out the fire at once.

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:23.010
My lord!

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:25.100
Your orders.

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:34.060
Bring Aileen Lauren d'Autriche to the ball.

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:44.450
Are you really not going to the ball?

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:46.970
I'm going to focus on my career!

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:50.390
I won't be executed if the 
engagement is dissolved, anyway.

00:03:50.390 --> 00:03:53.420
It doesn't matter anymore 
if I'm disowned, either!

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:57.600
Then why don't you move out 
of the demon lord's castle?

00:03:57.600 --> 00:04:01.420
B-Because Almond and the other 
demons begged me to stay!

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:04.830
They even did a "don't leave us" dance for me!

00:04:07.530 --> 00:04:09.920
Lady Aileen, I have a package for you.

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:14.190
What's this?

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:16.320
It's your dress for the ball in two days.

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:18.310
What's this all about?

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:23.730
My lord has instructed me to have you 
attend the ball wearing this dress.

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:24.300
Huh?

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:26.200
Aileen...

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:32.830
A-After all that's happened?!

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:35.370
I-I'm not going!

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:40.020
I was ordered to make you attend, 
even if you cry, complain, or risk execution.

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:45.360
Even without his memories, 
my lord has not changed.

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:48.570
He'd rather die than let go 
of the things he fancies.

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:54.740
"Fancies"?! Even after I slapped him?!

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:58.470
The demon lord probably fell in 
love with Lady Aileen again!

00:05:00.470 --> 00:05:02.840
I-I won't go, no matter what!

00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:04.490
Now, now. Please don't be so stubborn.

00:05:04.730 --> 00:05:08.490
Aileen, go! Demon lord is calling dance!

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:36.010
I-Isaac!

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:37.520
Just give up.

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:39.360
What?!

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:46.940
<i>He was so cold when I tried to seduce him,</i>

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:49.940
<i>but he chases me down after I'd given up.</i>

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:53.740
<i>I know they say men are 
creatures that enjoy the hunt,</i>

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:55.800
<i>but this is really unforgivable!</i>

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:03.250
<i>I have my pride, too!</i>

00:06:08.070 --> 00:06:09.400
That's...

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:10.260
What?

00:06:16.330 --> 00:06:17.780
<i>Lord Claude...</i>

00:06:19.510 --> 00:06:22.040
<i>I'll make you regret</i>

00:06:24.430 --> 00:06:26.530
<i>inviting me here!</i>

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:34.210
Why...

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:36.560
Why are you wearing a duck head?

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:39.250
I was ordered to attend wearing this dress.

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:41.540
There were no stipulations 
about head accessories.

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:47.310
Why are you being so resistant?

00:06:47.310 --> 00:06:50.300
This duck style is currently in fashion!

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:52.810
There's no way that's true. Take it off.

00:06:52.810 --> 00:06:57.420
No! I do not wish to show my 
face to you, Lord Claude!

00:06:59.550 --> 00:07:00.350
Huh?!

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:05.070
Wait, Lord Claude! 
This is too improper of you!

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:09.400
I don't want to hear that from a woman who 
came to the ball wearing a duck head.

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:14.180
Make way.

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:21.650
Just what are you trying to do?

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:34.810
May I hug you?

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:35.800
Huh?!

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:44.300
You must be joking! I really will get mad...

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:51.580
My body knows exactly how much 
strength I should use to hug you.

00:07:53.270 --> 00:07:59.080
Keith told me to bring my face close 
to you and try calling your name.

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:02.820
What nonsense is he trying to teach you?! 
What good will that do?

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:04.340
Aileen.

00:08:07.910 --> 00:08:09.080
Aileen.

00:08:11.060 --> 00:08:15.790
I see. You're not as experienced 
with men as you say you are.

00:08:16.610 --> 00:08:18.210
I was fooled.

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:22.980
Th-That's not true! I...

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:25.340
Should I test things out a bit more?

00:08:25.340 --> 00:08:28.480
How indecent! We're not even married!

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:29.950
Aileen.

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:33.400
I love you.

00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:37.910
Love me? You love me?

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:41.120
Yes, I love you.

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:45.390
I want to make you cry, and spoil you 
so rotten you can't live without me.

00:08:45.390 --> 00:08:48.100
You still feel that way 
without your memories?!

00:08:48.660 --> 00:08:53.440
It seems my love for you doesn't change, 
whether I have my memories or not.

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:55.620
It must be fate.

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:57.290
After all this...

00:08:57.290 --> 00:09:00.300
You think a few simple words 
will make me forgive you?

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:01.420
Kind of.

00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:05.040
I-I want to cut it off!

00:09:05.740 --> 00:09:09.360
Then let's do this instead, Aileen.

00:09:10.810 --> 00:09:14.360
Until you feel like forgiving me, 
you can do whatever you want...

00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:16.860
to both my face and my body.

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:19.870
As if I could do that!

00:09:20.630 --> 00:09:23.080
I see. That's too bad.

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:26.620
I was so excited to see what you would do.

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:30.720
Are you aware that the things you're saying 
are the complete opposite from last time?!

00:09:30.950 --> 00:09:33.450
Love changes people.

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:36.990
Y-You just think you'll be forgiven if 
you say things in an attractive way...

00:09:37.230 --> 00:09:38.660
Forget it!

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:40.900
I just need to forgive you, right?!

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:43.770
Let's go back, then.

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:47.430
We have to dance together to 
show others where we stand.

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:50.600
Please go on ahead.

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:53.480
I'm going to fix my make-up.

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:56.110
You're beautiful as you are.

00:09:56.590 --> 00:09:58.620
I don't want to let you go right now.

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:01.540
Th-That's unacceptable!

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:04.620
If I have to dance with you in this state...

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:06.410
I'd rather wear the duck head!

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:10.500
I understand.

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:13.800
I'll head to the hall first.

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:18.260
As expected of you, Lady Aileen.

00:10:18.740 --> 00:10:21.130
You made Lord Claude fall for 
you with a slap on the face!

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:23.830
Huh? That? That's what you're focused on?

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:28.280
I'll bring a lip color that matches 
your dress. Please wait a moment.

00:10:35.050 --> 00:10:38.800
<i>Lord Claude said he loves me!</i>

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:45.870
You look quite happy, Lady Aileen.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:52.040
Voice: Yuuki Ono

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:52.040
An aide of the demon lord. 
He is a cold beauty with long, 
straight hair and clay-colored 
skin. Completely loyal to the
 demon lord, he will follow
 any order Claude gives him. 
He is a high-leveled demon 
who has some influence over
 the demons below him.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:52.040
m 0 0 l 275 0 l 275 174 l 0 174

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:54.490
Elephas, what's the meaning of this?

00:10:54.490 --> 00:10:59.040
I don't believe in love, 
so I didn't think this would happen.

00:10:59.990 --> 00:11:03.660
At this rate, the demon lord 
may regain his memories.

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:05.060
I can't have that.

00:11:05.380 --> 00:11:10.050
<i>In the game, Elephas was a character who 
turned Lord Claude back into a demon lord.</i>

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:13.890
<i>I let my guard down because 
of his original plotline.</i>

00:11:18.260 --> 00:11:21.060
You were a wonderful master.

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:24.460
I wish I had met you before I met her.

00:11:24.460 --> 00:11:26.050
Oh? Before you met whom?

00:11:26.050 --> 00:11:29.940
Who's the true master that 
you rejected me for?

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:32.830
She's a monstrous woman.

00:11:33.050 --> 00:11:36.470
It looks like I'll have to save you, then.

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:39.690
It's useless.

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:42.870
Almond?

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:45.850
He's alive, of course. For now.

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:48.980
You coward! I can't believe 
you took a demon hostage!

00:11:48.980 --> 00:11:52.180
Demons are truly innocent and stupid.

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:54.640
He didn't even suspect me.

00:11:57.750 --> 00:12:01.650
All that's left is for the 
actors to fulfill their roles.

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:02.730
Actors?

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:09.240
Lord Leicester! Over here! 
Lady Aileen is using demon incense!

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:15.150
How unfortunate, Lady Aileen.

00:12:18.950 --> 00:12:22.250
<i>This looks like the beginning 
of a very poorly-acted play.</i>

00:12:23.670 --> 00:12:24.780
What?

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:26.320
What's going on?

00:12:34.220 --> 00:12:35.930
Leicester! What's going on?

00:12:35.930 --> 00:12:38.230
While I can't tell you the details,

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:42.240
it seems she planned to make 
demons attack using demon incense.

00:12:42.500 --> 00:12:43.690
Demons?!

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:45.240
No way!

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:52.240
She wants to turn the imperial crown prince

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:56.100
back into the demon lord and have him 
use demons to take this empire.

00:12:56.100 --> 00:12:57.720
My! How terrifying!

00:12:57.720 --> 00:13:00.340
We should have her executed 
immediately, Pierre!

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:03.550
You're right. We can't leave things be.

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:06.340
There's something else.

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:12.980
She had relationships with various men 
while the imperial crown prince was her fiancé.

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:14.520
Wh-What?!

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:17.330
Now, please convince Lord Claude.

00:13:17.740 --> 00:13:20.240
If you value the life of 
that demon crow, that is.

00:13:22.720 --> 00:13:26.260
Lord Claude, you know this man, don't you?

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:30.250
It seems that Lady Aileen has spent 
many nights together with him.

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:35.590
My apologies, Lord Claude!

00:13:35.590 --> 00:13:40.490
I... No, <i>we've</i> betrayed you!

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:42.980
We?

00:13:43.370 --> 00:13:45.130
What are you saying?!

00:13:46.750 --> 00:13:48.650
Elephas, you...

00:13:48.170 --> 00:13:49.290
Calm down!

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:53.080
I don't care what happens to me,

00:13:53.690 --> 00:13:56.880
but please spare Lady Aileen.

00:13:56.880 --> 00:13:59.270
I-I can't believe you'd spout such nonsense!

00:13:59.530 --> 00:14:02.020
Don't believe a word he says, Lord Claude!

00:14:02.290 --> 00:14:06.670
Lady Aileen! You were the one who told 
me you were lonely and needed company...

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:11.540
Were you lying when you said I 
was the only one you could trust?!

00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:12.770
That's enough!

00:14:14.920 --> 00:14:17.100
Tell me you love me.

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:20.170
If you tell me that, I'll believe you.

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:26.430
<i>I should have told him earlier 
that I loved him, too.</i>

00:14:35.570 --> 00:14:36.930
What a stupid man.

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:37.810
What?

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:43.930
I tried to hold it in until now. I mean, 
you're the crown prince, after all.

00:14:43.930 --> 00:14:49.900
But I'm at my limit. 
It disgusts me to be loved by you.

00:14:49.900 --> 00:14:51.500
What do you mean?

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:53.310
Think about it.

00:14:53.310 --> 00:15:00.800
Why would a human like me 
really love a demon lord?

00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:07.030
You don't even remember your true form!

00:15:07.030 --> 00:15:08.050
You monster!

00:15:08.490 --> 00:15:09.290
No!

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:14.290
No, demon lord! Aileen lies!

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:15.860
Lied on purpose!

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:23.320
<i>He shouldn't have done that.</i>

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:26.300
<i>No...</i>

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:33.000
<i>Tell me this isn't real...</i>

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:44.480
Almond?

00:15:56.920 --> 00:16:00.300
L-Lord Claude! Please stop!

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:04.650
Aileen?

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:10.600
Lord Claude? Are your memories...

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:13.360
Kill that girl immediately!

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:15.990
She's a traitor who tried to 
turn my son into a demon lord!

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:17.000
Yes, my liege!

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:18.000
Yes, my liege!

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:23.990
Suppress all the demons in 
the forest! Immediately!

00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:26.240
Mobilize the holy knights and the army!

00:16:26.240 --> 00:16:27.740
P-Please wait!

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:30.720
Lord Claude!

00:16:30.720 --> 00:16:32.750
You can't! Run for now!

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:34.080
B-But...

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:35.120
Lady Aileen!

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:39.630
Elephas! Kill that little whelp immediately!

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:46.900
Run, Aileen!

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:50.390
The demons... Until I return...

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:51.890
Lord Claude!

00:17:01.480 --> 00:17:02.500
Aileen!

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:05.570
Aileen, it's our lord!

00:17:06.650 --> 00:17:09.670
I felt the power of our 
lord for just a moment!

00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:11.670
But something's wrong.

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:14.350
I can no longer feel Almond's presence.

00:17:17.270 --> 00:17:21.890
Almond is by Lord Claude's side.
 I'm sure he's fine.

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:25.000
The knights will be here soon.

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:27.180
We'll be surrounded if we don't act fast.

00:17:28.030 --> 00:17:30.080
Get a hold of yourself, Aileen.

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:32.230
You're going to be the wife 
of the demon lord, right?

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:37.000
Isaac, do you have a way 
for everyone to escape?

00:17:37.770 --> 00:17:39.020
Of course.

00:17:40.680 --> 00:17:42.810
A-An underground labyrinth?

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:47.760
Yes! We can easily get the outside 
the capital from the castle.

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:49.670
We stashed supplies in the labyrinth,

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:52.050
so we could probably survive 
in it for at least half a year?

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:53.820
As expected of Denis!

00:17:53.820 --> 00:17:55.930
The giant moles are pleased 
with the labyrinth, as well!

00:17:55.930 --> 00:18:01.580
Yes! I made the labyrinth look 
ominous, just like you requested!

00:18:01.980 --> 00:18:04.870
I can't believe you built 
something like this here...

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:14.710
Now, everyone.

00:18:14.710 --> 00:18:18.240
I know many of you are uneasy without 
the presence of the demon lord,

00:18:18.730 --> 00:18:22.250
so I will act as his proxy from this point on!

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:29.720
Many of you may not know this,

00:18:29.720 --> 00:18:35.250
but I was given the right to bestow 
orders in place of our lord, just once.

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:37.010
He was?

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:42.630
Yeah. Lord Claude cast this magic 
to prepare for an emergency.

00:18:42.630 --> 00:18:44.310
The spell is called...

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:45.930
Acting Demon Lord!

00:18:50.820 --> 00:18:54.240
All demons should leave 
the demon lord's castle.

00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:57.460
Stay far away from the imperial 
capital full of humans.

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:02.310
Wow...

00:19:07.180 --> 00:19:11.910
Have you forgotten? 
I'm Lord Claude's right-hand man!

00:19:24.830 --> 00:19:27.040
You turned back into the demon lord, I see.

00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:29.010
You're just a side character.

00:19:29.010 --> 00:19:31.180
Aileen's the main character, you know.

00:19:31.180 --> 00:19:32.810
What are you talking about?

00:19:33.260 --> 00:19:36.390
But I never thought there'd be a character 
whose romance path I couldn't complete

00:19:36.950 --> 00:19:38.440
I'm a little impressed.

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:42.220
No wonder Lady Aileen chose you.

00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:43.950
So, Lord Claude...

00:19:48.070 --> 00:19:50.450
I'll let you play the heroine.

00:19:57.860 --> 00:20:01.720
You're the one who took my memories?

00:20:02.750 --> 00:20:03.780
That's a secret.

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:07.230
The main character is the one who has to 
solve the mystery and cast judgment.

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:23.740
I didn't think we'd really have to
 participate in a dungeon crawler...

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:27.230
Did everyone who went ahead 
of us make it safely?

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:28.970
You shouldn't be worried about them.

00:20:28.970 --> 00:20:31.440
They were supposed to 
meet us here, though...

00:20:31.740 --> 00:20:34.750
Everyone knows where the 
meeting point is, right?

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:36.790
Let's meet there if something happens.

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:39.390
Message! Message!

00:20:39.390 --> 00:20:40.790
The cavalry is coming!

00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:42.750
Prepare! Prepare!

00:20:43.060 --> 00:20:45.750
This is bad...

00:20:46.020 --> 00:20:47.750
I'll act as a decoy.

00:20:48.030 --> 00:20:51.680
I'll pretend to be Lady Aileen and 
lead them away from our trail.

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:55.040
Y-You can't! You have to escape with us!

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:57.770
Lady Aileen, please meet up with the demons.

00:20:57.770 --> 00:20:59.390
B-But...

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:01.900
Isaac.

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:07.660
We're counting on you.

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:08.900
Isaac!

00:21:08.900 --> 00:21:11.790
It'll be fine. We'll protect her.

00:21:12.270 --> 00:21:13.710
I'll go, too.

00:21:13.710 --> 00:21:17.040
It's better if someone who can 
communicate with demons comes along.

00:21:19.450 --> 00:21:21.400
Don't worry, Ribbon.

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:23.150
Everyone...

00:21:33.690 --> 00:21:34.950
N-No!

00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:36.930
Elephas?!

00:21:36.930 --> 00:21:41.690
It wasn't that hard to find 
a demon of this size.

00:21:43.820 --> 00:21:47.690
No one move. Unless you want 
to fall to your death.

00:21:50.710 --> 00:21:54.300
Now, let's return to the 
imperial palace together.

00:21:54.300 --> 00:21:56.970
You really think I'll do as you say?

00:21:57.670 --> 00:21:59.700
Th-The holy sword is activating on its own?!
